=2 Walkthrough
* Go back to the {p:Shattered Telepoint} at the {p:Crag of Holla}, {p:Dem|Crag of Dem}, or {p:Mea|Crag of Mea}.
** It doesn't matter if you go to a different one than before.

=2 Notes
* After completing this mission, you will be able to purchase Coffer keys from the {p:Curio Vendor Moogle}.
** These keys are generally useful for acquiring {i:job AF armor|AF} found in coffers, as well as easily completing {q:The Road to Aht Urhgan|The Road to Aht Urhgan|The Road to Aht Urhgan}.
* If you are playing solo, after {k:"Rhapsody in Umber"} you won't get the next of the {p:Rhapsody key items} until around level 80 due to a required NM battle.
